  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Glorious Arena</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Life Sphere (any (Vitality) talent), ability to gain martial focus or use skill leverage</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you would gain or grant temporary hit points using a combat sphere or skill sphere ability, you may spend a spell point to apply a (Vitality) talent to one target affected. If you possess the Mass Healing talent, you may spend an additional spell point to apply the (Vitality) talent to all targets affected, to a maximum of Mass Healing’s normal maximum.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc115\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
